{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-11-29 18:44:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS DECLARES PREFERRED DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, NOV. 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO. (SOCALGAS) HAS DECLARED REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS FOR THE PREFERRED SERIES STOCK OF THE COMPANY AS FOLLOWS: SOCALGAS: PREFERRED STOCK\xa0 $0.375 PER SHARE PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES A\xa0 $0.375 PER SHARE THE DIVIDENDS ARE PAYABLE ON JANUARY 15, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 10, 2021. ABOUT SOCALGAS HEADQUARTERED IN\xa0LOS ANGELES,\xa0SOCALGAS®\xa0IS THE\xa0LARGEST GAS DISTRIBUTION UTILITY\xa0IN\xa0THE\xa0UNITED STATES.'}